BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to bring your A-game! The Brother-to-Brother Lawn Tak
 eover: Auraria Ninja Warrior is coming to campus — and you don’t want 
 to miss it. This high-energy event is your chance to connect with fellow M
 SU Denver students\, share experiences\, and build friendships that go bey
 ond the classroom. Form your crew and take on multiple inflatable obstacle
  courses in a thrilling competition — 8 teams of 6 will battle for bragg
 ing rights! Between runs\, enjoy fun lawn games\, great music\, and food i
 n a relaxed\, supportive atmosphere. Whether you’re here for the competi
 tion\, the connections\, or just the food\, the Auraria Ninja Warrior chal
 lenge is all about bonding\, laughter\, and community. Gather your squad a
 nd let’s see who will reign supreme! -J. Gunnells Assistant Director\, B
 2B Program\n\n\n\nFrom: jgunnell@msudenver.edu\nWhen: 4:00 PM - 8:00 P
 M September 10\, 2025\nSubject: B2B Lawn Takeover: Auraria Ninja Warrior E
 dition\nLocation: JSSB Lawn\n\n\n
