 ___\nFrom: Toni Aho <ahot@msudenver.edu>\nSent: Wednesday\, November 19\, 
 2025 9:34:36 AM (UTC-07:00) Mountain Time (US & Canada)\nTo: Center for Mu
 lticultural Engagement and Inclusion <CMEI4493@msudenver.onmicrosoft.com>\
 ; Alicia Montoya <amonto64@msudenver.edu>\; Zamir Atkins <maatkins@msudenv
 er.edu>\; Sena Bryant <sbryan26@msudenver.edu>\; Diyonus Walls <dwalls3@ms
 udenver.edu>\; Oanh Yen Luong <luongoa@msudenver.edu>\; Jermaine Gunnells 
