 ; Deserea Richards <dricha64@msudenver.edu>\; Pamela Packer <ppacker@msude
 nver.edu>\; Armando Rijo <arijo@msudenver.edu>\; Cynthia Baron <baron@msud
 enver.edu>\; Stephen Thomas Cucchiara <stcucchiar@msudenver.edu>\nCc: Pade
 r Yang <pyang10@msudenver.edu>\; Berenice Perez <bperez41@msudenver.edu>\n
 Subject: Armando Send Off Celebration\nWhen: Wednesday\, December 17\, 202
 5 9:00 AM-11:00 AM.\nWhere: Tiv 305\n\nCome give your thanks and good wish
 es to Armando as he departs MSU Denver for his next adventure as the Direc
 tor of Fraternity/Sorority Life at University of Tampa. We'll have some fo
 od\, some music\, and some kleenex 🙂\n\nPlease forward this invite to y
 our student employees and others you know would want to stop by.\n\n\n
