DESCRIPTION:Hi all\,\n\nI'd like to work on some planning for the remainder
  of the semester and work through some needs.\n\nBefore I lose Sarah & Ale
 jandro\, I'd like to see if we can accomplish a few things in prep for AY2
 7:\n\n\n  *\nUpdated handbooks (orgs\, org funding\, FSL)\n  *\nUpdate fun
 ding policies\n  *\nUpdate training flow\n  *\nReservations and schedule f
 or AY27 trainings\n\nThanks all!\n\nToni\n-I figured after we got through 
 the bulk of this\, we can walk over to Brooklyn's or Quadside\, or where-e
 ver you would like to eat 🙂\n
