DESCRIPTION:Here's a friendly reminder regarding the required\, in-person O
 rientation to meet the donor.\n\nThis is currently the only option to atte
 nd an in-person orientation session offered for Spring and Summer 2026 gra
 duates. Participants must attend an in-person orientation in order to be e
 ligible for the $1\,500 Roth IRA contribution. Feel free to 'Accept' this 
 invitation\; however\, sign up is not required.\n\nIf new sessions are add
 ed or we receive updates about this requirement from the donor\, we will c
 ommunicate from the firstgen@msudenver.edu email address. Please monitor y
 our email to be aware of any updates. In the meantime\, please do your bes
 t to prioritize this orientation and reach out to firstgen@msudenver.edu w
 ith any questions or concerns.\n
